### Register candidate

POST http://localhost:4000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userType": "candidate",
  "name": "test",
  "email": "test@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}


### Refresh session
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/refresh


### Logout
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/logout
